33
00:00:45,044 --> 00:00:47,165
The dragon changed
who's in charge.

34
00:00:47,185 --> 00:00:48,652
Don't just add a
dragon.

35
00:00:48,672 --> 00:00:50,164
Ask what ordinary
people do

36
00:00:50,184 --> 00:00:51,115
differently.

37
00:00:51,135 --> 00:00:52,407
What would your
civilization invent

38
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:53,869
